WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:16,830
In a past call, you said not to sleep with the grouting pad or the eye on footband.

00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:22,770
Is it okay to sleep with a half sheet grouting pad, whether the grouting sheets that you

00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:33,910
sell at your site? Does it work okay with nightly use of the right machine? Yes, it does.

00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:41,490
I suggest that you use it on the lower half of your band on your full bed. I suggest you use

00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:49,010
it on the waist down where your waist would be more than likely when you're lying or sleeping

00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:58,070
in your bed, put it underneath your fitted sheet from the waist down so that the idea is

00:00:58,070 --> 00:01:06,490
that the possibility exists that you roll over and your bulb is laid on the sheet and you're two feet

00:01:06,490 --> 00:01:12,430
away from the bulb. You're losing a lot of frequencies right to the ground if it's laid on the

00:01:12,430 --> 00:01:19,150
ground sheet and you're getting less going through your body. So if you're really good at holding the

00:01:19,150 --> 00:01:24,550
bulb on your chest and stuggling with it on your belly and stuggling with it and you sleep on your

00:01:24,550 --> 00:01:29,910
back all night, then you could actually have it on the full sheet. I don't see any problem with that at

00:01:29,910 --> 00:01:34,950
all, but if you roll over to your side at all and the bulb ends up on your side and get

00:01:34,950 --> 00:01:43,110
away to your bed and you have the sheet of the full part of the bed, then you could effectively be

00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:46,790
losing some of the frequencies right to the ground because that's what's going to be attracted to.

00:01:46,790 --> 00:01:54,550
I'm going to answer this question multiple times on multiple zoom calls. I'm pretty sure we have

00:01:54,550 --> 00:02:03,030
split up on the right portion of the member site. So please look at that. I don't like to answer any

00:02:03,030 --> 00:02:10,550
questions again. That's no problem, but do look at the right questions. Do look at the right section of

00:02:10,550 --> 00:02:18,550
the member site as well so that you can kind of not have to wait to answer, get to the answer to your

00:02:18,550 --> 00:02:20,550
question.

